    Do not commit .env or access credentials. ================================================== DIGITALOCEAN DEPLOYMENT REQUIREMENTS ================================================== Assume a Linux-based DigitalOcean Droplet, but do not guess the Linux distribution version. Ask me to confirm the operating system and Python version before producing OS-specific commands. Provide:
    Python virtualenv setup.
